{"c":[{"id":"30d8beae6ea2a379","sum":"Onboarding's know step shows only when a memoryReply list names op add in 'ops' (host contract, memory.ndjson); until the helper sends ops, the step stays hidden (A12).","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261003T155259Z-0e3686f311fbff4b","text":"Onboarding's know step shows only when a memoryReply list carries ops naming add (host contract, Tests/CaretHostCoreTests/Fixtures/memory.ndjson); today's helper sends no ops, so the step is hidden until B17 adds the op and the ops field (A12).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261003T155327Z-6557f0a64fa5989e","text":"Onboarding's know step shows only when a memoryReply list names op add in 'ops' (host contract, memory.ndjson). Today's helper sends no ops, so the step stays hidden until the screen track adds the op and the field (A12).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"43e4c498eba10341","sum":"A12: debug-socket 'inject helperLine' takes the helper route, gate included (pass your own --settings). SurfaceGate forgives Grammarly's layer-1 ring (field +64 pt) via the live focused frame, or every TextEdit offer is held covered.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20261003T155327Z-d8b7c9de6967162d","text":"Debug-socket 'inject helperLine' takes the helper-socket route, gate included (A12): an injected action is a helper offer whose Tab sends offerAccept. Scripts that inject must pass their own --settings, or a paused or Fill-off user file refuses it.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261003T182128Z-e49f48ead18a928c","text":"Grammarly Desktop (UIElement agent) keeps a layer-1 alpha-1 window at the focused field grown 64 pt per side; SurfaceGate skips such agent rings via the live focused frame (ringsField), or every TextEdit offer is held 'covered' (A12).","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
